1
00:01:38,110 --> 00:01:43,060
[Shadow Punisher]

2
00:01:43,130 --> 00:01:43,710
[Divine Constable Tally]

3
00:01:43,710 --> 00:01:45,940
[Episode 19]

4
00:01:46,640 --> 00:01:47,560
Qin Dayuan,

5
00:01:49,560 --> 00:01:51,479
I know you can hear me.

6
00:01:53,070 --> 00:01:55,000
Didn't you set up these 7 fish tanks

7
00:01:55,229 --> 00:01:56,039
just to let me

8
00:01:56,039 --> 00:01:57,430
see through the mechanism

9
00:01:57,430 --> 00:01:58,870
and lure me to this place?

10
00:02:00,040 --> 00:02:01,070
If so,

11
00:02:01,480 --> 00:02:03,510
why are you hiding now?

12
00:02:15,560 --> 00:02:16,280
If I recall correctly,

13
00:02:16,280 --> 00:02:17,590
Tang Wei was unmarried, right?

14
00:02:17,590 --> 00:02:18,310
Yes.

15
00:02:18,560 --> 00:02:20,430
Tang Yiming died 10 years ago.

16
00:02:20,590 --> 00:02:22,280
Tang Wei attained an epiphany
and devoted himself to Taoism,

17
00:02:22,280 --> 00:02:23,540
vowing never to marry.

18
00:02:23,680 --> 00:02:24,710
If so,

19
00:02:25,000 --> 00:02:25,860
check that out.

20
00:02:27,870 --> 00:02:28,630
Why is there

21
00:02:28,630 --> 00:02:29,960
a baby's pillow?

22
00:02:30,150 --> 00:02:31,360
And why is this baby's pillow

23
00:02:31,360 --> 00:02:32,800
made of stone?

24
00:02:48,590 --> 00:02:50,650
The fish tanks are all in the same spot

25
00:02:51,030 --> 00:02:52,190
in each room from the 1st floor

26
00:02:52,190 --> 00:02:53,430
to the 7th.

27
00:02:55,630 --> 00:02:58,690
The spots where the moonlight
reflects on the ceilings

28
00:02:59,210 --> 00:03:01,240
through the fish tanks,

29
00:03:01,430 --> 00:03:03,030
from the 1st to the 7th floors,

30
00:03:03,030 --> 00:03:04,590
are also almost the same.

31
00:03:11,470 --> 00:03:13,200
Except for this huge deviation

32
00:03:14,190 --> 00:03:15,840
on the 7th floor.

33
00:03:16,870 --> 00:03:18,120
This is due to

34
00:03:20,190 --> 00:03:22,190
the different height of this floor.

35
00:03:22,240 --> 00:03:22,960
Each floor

36
00:03:22,960 --> 00:03:25,000
of Lanyue Pavilion from the 1st to the 6th

37
00:03:25,000 --> 00:03:26,680
is about 5 meters high.

38
00:03:27,000 --> 00:03:28,310
But this 7th floor

39
00:03:28,750 --> 00:03:30,520
is clearly much shorter.

40
00:03:30,840 --> 00:03:32,770
There's only one way to explain it—

41
00:03:32,960 --> 00:03:34,800
there is a hidden space

42
00:03:35,430 --> 00:03:37,280
above this 7th floor.

43
00:05:16,040 --> 00:05:17,070
Something's off.

44
00:05:17,630 --> 00:05:19,560
This mechanism is way too obvious.

45
00:05:19,750 --> 00:05:21,800
We just found out Tang Wei
committed suicide,

46
00:05:21,800 --> 00:05:22,540
and then you guys

47
00:05:22,540 --> 00:05:24,430
found his suicide note so quickly?

48
00:05:24,430 --> 00:05:26,030
Tang Wei's parents are dead.

49
00:05:26,070 --> 00:05:27,530
He had no wife or children.

50
00:05:27,630 --> 00:05:29,040
Then who did he

51
00:05:29,480 --> 00:05:31,040
write this suicide note to?

52
00:05:31,430 --> 00:05:32,690
And who does this word,

53
00:05:33,040 --> 00:05:34,510
"you," refer to?

54
00:05:34,800 --> 00:05:36,730
Seems like Tang Wei's suicide note

55
00:05:37,480 --> 00:05:38,870
was also meant for us.

56
00:06:30,560 --> 00:06:31,480
Qin Dayuan,

57
00:06:32,270 --> 00:06:34,040
if you still don't show yourself,

58
00:06:34,040 --> 00:06:35,870
don't blame me for being rude.

59
00:07:16,160 --> 00:07:16,950
Huang Gang.

60
00:07:24,630 --> 00:07:25,600
Jiang Zeshui.

61
00:07:25,830 --> 00:07:27,510
Ascend to Heaven.

62
00:07:33,680 --> 00:07:35,220
Is this

63
00:07:35,560 --> 00:07:38,820
General Hu Hai who jumped
into the furnace for liberation?

64
00:08:00,190 --> 00:08:02,270
I once read the records
in Tianshu Pavilion.

65
00:08:02,270 --> 00:08:04,560
"Liluo has pearls, often seen in darkness;

66
00:08:04,560 --> 00:08:07,190
they don't gleam like the moon,
but blaze like the sun."

67
00:08:07,190 --> 00:08:08,630
So it's a luminous pearl.

68
00:08:08,800 --> 00:08:10,630
Throughout the records
of hundreds of years,

69
00:08:10,630 --> 00:08:12,070
there is only one luminous pearl

70
00:08:12,070 --> 00:08:13,200
as large as this one.

71
00:08:13,240 --> 00:08:15,120
It is Liluo's national treasure,

72
00:08:15,270 --> 00:08:16,200
the Mirror Moon.

73
00:08:16,430 --> 00:08:18,040
After Liluo fell, they searched

74
00:08:18,040 --> 00:08:19,020
the entire national treasury

75
00:08:19,020 --> 00:08:20,360
but failed to find this Mirror Moon.

76
00:08:20,360 --> 00:08:21,830
Never thought it would be here.

77
00:08:21,830 --> 00:08:22,950
Tang Yiming was an official

78
00:08:22,950 --> 00:08:25,040
credited with conquering Liluo back then.

79
00:08:25,040 --> 00:08:26,160
He must have

80
00:08:26,480 --> 00:08:27,530
looted plenty of treasures

81
00:08:27,530 --> 00:08:29,330
from the Liluo Imperial Palace.

82
00:08:30,750 --> 00:08:33,150
Who exactly is this corpse?

83
00:08:38,630 --> 00:08:39,549
Qin Dayuan?

84
00:08:40,240 --> 00:08:42,080
Then who is

85
00:08:42,360 --> 00:08:43,690
inside this 4th statue?

86
00:08:44,080 --> 00:08:44,910
The corpse

87
00:08:44,910 --> 00:08:46,550
inside this 4th statue

88
00:08:47,150 --> 00:08:49,080
is the former Minister of Works.

89
00:08:52,510 --> 00:08:53,910
He was also my master,

90
00:08:55,120 --> 00:08:56,080
Tang Yiming.

91
00:08:57,910 --> 00:08:59,440
Why is he here?

92
00:08:59,910 --> 00:09:01,370
He went missing 3 days ago.

93
00:09:01,510 --> 00:09:02,840
Why did he die here?

94
00:09:11,870 --> 00:09:12,960
Butler Qin.

95
00:09:17,510 --> 00:09:18,960
It must've been rough,

96
00:09:19,840 --> 00:09:21,840
lurking in the darkness

97
00:09:21,910 --> 00:09:23,910
on the 8th floor of Lanyue Pavilion.

98
00:09:23,960 --> 00:09:25,160
But it's reasonable.

99
00:09:25,910 --> 00:09:28,360
The Divine Constable Bureau
is searching everywhere.

100
00:09:28,360 --> 00:09:30,020
There's no way you can escape.

101
00:09:30,080 --> 00:09:30,910
Well?

102
00:09:32,270 --> 00:09:33,270
At this point,

103
00:09:34,440 --> 00:09:36,500
are you still not going to come clean?

104
00:09:41,320 --> 00:09:42,650
How should I come clean?

105
00:09:43,670 --> 00:09:44,650
Why don't we

106
00:09:45,510 --> 00:09:47,360
start with Kongyuzi?

107
00:09:51,080 --> 00:09:53,080
Since you mentioned this name,

108
00:09:53,960 --> 00:09:55,910
you must know she was my wife.

109
00:09:56,150 --> 00:09:58,150
You were husband and wife after all.

110
00:09:59,080 --> 00:10:01,270
Why did you have to kill her?

111
00:10:04,720 --> 00:10:05,510
Because

112
00:10:06,670 --> 00:10:07,910
there was one thing

113
00:10:08,510 --> 00:10:09,910
you couldn't accomplish

114
00:10:10,440 --> 00:10:12,510
without killing her.

115
00:10:14,870 --> 00:10:16,470
Divine Constable Qingyang.

116
00:10:18,960 --> 00:10:20,440
Do you want to guess...

117
00:10:23,080 --> 00:10:24,360
what I

118
00:10:25,240 --> 00:10:26,100
accomplished?

119
00:10:30,960 --> 00:10:31,790
Huang Gang,

120
00:10:32,960 --> 00:10:34,080
Jiang Zeshui,

121
00:10:34,320 --> 00:10:35,840
Hu Hai, Tang Yiming—

122
00:10:36,080 --> 00:10:37,150
the four of them

123
00:10:37,360 --> 00:10:39,420
once joined forces to destroy Liluo.

124
00:10:40,080 --> 00:10:41,200
Their deaths

125
00:10:42,080 --> 00:10:43,790
are Liluo's revenge.

126
00:10:44,120 --> 00:10:45,630
You got it half right.

127
00:10:46,240 --> 00:10:47,640
Huang Gang and the others

128
00:10:48,550 --> 00:10:50,240
caused too much bloodshed

129
00:10:50,720 --> 00:10:52,250
when they destroyed Liluo,

130
00:10:52,670 --> 00:10:54,020
so it was only natural

131
00:10:54,080 --> 00:10:55,340
for them to feel uneasy

132
00:10:56,080 --> 00:10:57,550
when they got old.

133
00:11:00,720 --> 00:11:02,480
Hu Hai and the other two
were long in the tooth.

134
00:11:02,480 --> 00:11:03,200
Because they had

135
00:11:03,200 --> 00:11:05,260
their hands coated in too much blood,

136
00:11:05,270 --> 00:11:06,670
they were scared of death

137
00:11:06,960 --> 00:11:08,720
and sought medical help everywhere,

138
00:11:08,720 --> 00:11:11,030
but to little avail.

139
00:11:13,440 --> 00:11:14,240
Therefore,

140
00:11:14,870 --> 00:11:16,480
Mr. Tang told them

141
00:11:16,840 --> 00:11:19,970
that he knew the way
to seek immortality and liberation.

142
00:11:20,390 --> 00:11:21,200
Hu Hai

143
00:11:22,630 --> 00:11:24,060
was the first one.

144
00:11:24,480 --> 00:11:25,480
The Young Master built

145
00:11:25,480 --> 00:11:27,240
a secret passage
in the sword-forging furnace.

146
00:11:27,240 --> 00:11:29,910
When Hu Hai fell
into the furnace for liberation,

147
00:11:29,910 --> 00:11:32,200
he took Hu Hai away, killed him,

148
00:11:32,360 --> 00:11:33,550
and sealed him here.

149
00:11:33,870 --> 00:11:35,870
Mr. Tang couldn't use martial arts.

150
00:11:36,440 --> 00:11:37,270
So of course,

151
00:11:37,510 --> 00:11:39,240
the Liluo demon-men helped him

152
00:11:39,320 --> 00:11:40,980
do everything you mentioned.

153
00:11:41,870 --> 00:11:44,390
But Huang Gang and Jiang Zeshui

154
00:11:44,670 --> 00:11:46,870
were no easy marks like Hu Hai.

155
00:11:47,510 --> 00:11:48,320
So,

156
00:11:49,360 --> 00:11:51,840
you renovated the Jiang Mansion
and Huang Mansion,

157
00:11:51,840 --> 00:11:53,080
using Lanweichun

158
00:11:53,550 --> 00:11:55,270
to hide the image of Haiqu,

159
00:11:55,270 --> 00:11:56,600
Liluo's God of Revenge,

160
00:11:56,670 --> 00:11:58,550
in the mural.

161
00:11:58,870 --> 00:12:00,480
This caused Haiqu's figure

162
00:12:00,550 --> 00:12:02,080
to flicker in and out of view,

163
00:12:02,080 --> 00:12:03,240
forcing the two veterans

164
00:12:03,240 --> 00:12:05,200
to believe in

165
00:12:05,480 --> 00:12:07,810
Tang Wei's theory of mystic cultivation.

166
00:12:13,030 --> 00:12:13,870
That day,

167
00:12:14,720 --> 00:12:16,270
Mr. Tang accurately foretold

168
00:12:16,270 --> 00:12:17,600
the date of his own death

169
00:12:17,840 --> 00:12:20,080
and jumped from this Lanyue Pavilion,

170
00:12:20,550 --> 00:12:23,080
convincing Huang Gang and the others

171
00:12:23,080 --> 00:12:24,270
completely.

172
00:12:24,870 --> 00:12:25,720
And then,

173
00:12:26,320 --> 00:12:28,120
he entrusted everything to you,

174
00:12:28,630 --> 00:12:30,320
leaving you to carry out

175
00:12:30,320 --> 00:12:31,750
the rest of the plan.

176
00:12:36,080 --> 00:12:37,680
You guessed this part right.

177
00:12:40,360 --> 00:12:42,220
In order to achieve immortality,

178
00:12:42,840 --> 00:12:43,720
they all

179
00:12:44,080 --> 00:12:46,140
ended up believing Tang Wei's words.

180
00:12:47,240 --> 00:12:48,030
Hence,

181
00:12:48,320 --> 00:12:50,720
Huang Gang climbed up
the "heaven ladder,"

182
00:12:51,120 --> 00:12:52,850
Jiang Zeshui crossed the lake,

183
00:12:53,440 --> 00:12:55,270
and Hu Hai jumped
into the sword-forging furnace.

184
00:12:55,270 --> 00:12:56,360
But in the end,

185
00:12:57,270 --> 00:12:59,080
they were all captured
by the Liluo demon-men

186
00:12:59,080 --> 00:13:00,440
and brought here.

187
00:13:02,510 --> 00:13:04,440
With the Liluo people on my side,

188
00:13:04,440 --> 00:13:05,440
why would I go

189
00:13:05,440 --> 00:13:07,080
to so much trouble

190
00:13:07,320 --> 00:13:10,050
instead of asking them
to kill the guys directly?

191
00:13:11,720 --> 00:13:13,580
You made Lord Huang and the others

192
00:13:13,840 --> 00:13:15,790
believe that ascension was real,

193
00:13:16,360 --> 00:13:18,120
only to reveal everything

194
00:13:18,120 --> 00:13:19,910
at the very last moment when they were

195
00:13:19,910 --> 00:13:21,440
so close to fulfilling their wishes,

196
00:13:21,440 --> 00:13:22,510
and tell them

197
00:13:22,720 --> 00:13:25,480
that ascension was actually a lie,

198
00:13:26,080 --> 00:13:28,080
letting them die in fear.

199
00:13:29,120 --> 00:13:30,000
Only in this way

200
00:13:30,630 --> 00:13:33,790
could the revenge be satisfying.

201
00:13:34,320 --> 00:13:35,750
The Master reached the immortal land.

202
00:13:35,750 --> 00:13:38,080
The whole Huang family fell off the cliff.

203
00:13:38,360 --> 00:13:39,870
Hu Hai's beloved little granddaughter

204
00:13:39,870 --> 00:13:40,870
took poison.

205
00:13:41,750 --> 00:13:43,810
If we hadn't arrived in time that day,

206
00:13:44,080 --> 00:13:47,340
the whole Jiang family would have
drowned in the lake, too.

207
00:13:51,320 --> 00:13:53,180
What a cruel and ruthless scheme.

208
00:13:54,080 --> 00:13:55,150
To seek revenge,

209
00:13:56,080 --> 00:13:58,140
you wiped out their entire families.

210
00:13:58,440 --> 00:14:01,670
Huang Gang, Jiang Zeshui, and Hu Hai.

211
00:14:02,320 --> 00:14:04,380
I brought the three of them over here.

212
00:14:04,510 --> 00:14:06,550
I told them ascension was a lie,

213
00:14:07,080 --> 00:14:08,600
and it was their greed

214
00:14:09,720 --> 00:14:11,520
that got their families killed,

215
00:14:11,840 --> 00:14:13,480
leaving them crying out

216
00:14:13,720 --> 00:14:15,240
in remorse

217
00:14:15,320 --> 00:14:17,270
with no response.

218
00:14:18,080 --> 00:14:19,010
My Lord, My Lady!

219
00:14:19,270 --> 00:14:20,270
My Lord, My Lady,

220
00:14:20,270 --> 00:14:21,120
Lord Yan reported that

221
00:14:21,120 --> 00:14:21,870
Divine Constable Qingyang

222
00:14:21,870 --> 00:14:23,600
went up Lanyue Pavilion alone!

223
00:14:23,720 --> 00:14:25,240
He went to Lanyue Pavilion alone.

224
00:14:25,240 --> 00:14:26,100
Could it be that

225
00:14:26,630 --> 00:14:27,960
he found out something?

226
00:14:29,120 --> 00:14:31,050
There is one thing that puzzles me.

227
00:14:31,630 --> 00:14:33,160
Tang Wei is one of the Tangs.

228
00:14:34,030 --> 00:14:36,030
Why would he take revenge for Liluo?

229
00:14:39,720 --> 00:14:41,920
Master Tang had a large and rich family,

230
00:14:42,150 --> 00:14:44,240
yet Tang Wei was his only child.

231
00:14:45,360 --> 00:14:46,080
Could it be...

232
00:14:46,080 --> 00:14:51,390
Because Tang Yiming was impotent.

233
00:14:52,150 --> 00:14:54,240
Tang Wei was not Tang Yiming's child?

234
00:14:55,320 --> 00:14:56,550
He was from Liluo?

235
00:15:01,080 --> 00:15:04,280
Divine Constable Qingyang,
you've finally got it right.

236
00:15:05,360 --> 00:15:07,030
How about I tell you

237
00:15:07,320 --> 00:15:08,360
a story?

238
00:15:12,550 --> 00:15:13,880
Forty-seven years ago,

239
00:15:14,910 --> 00:15:17,240
Great Shi attacked the capital of Liluo,

240
00:15:18,670 --> 00:15:22,080
while the Moon Queen of the Kingdom
of Liluo, Qiangong Linglong,

241
00:15:22,080 --> 00:15:23,600
was about to give birth.

242
00:15:25,860 --> 00:15:28,490
[Qiangong Linglong,
Regent Moon Queen of Liluo]

243
00:15:39,030 --> 00:15:40,360
Greetings, Moon Queen.

244
00:15:40,960 --> 00:15:43,290
Who is the father
of the child in your womb?

245
00:15:43,360 --> 00:15:45,090
Please forgive me, Moon Queen.

246
00:15:45,240 --> 00:15:46,630
The child is innocent.

247
00:15:47,150 --> 00:15:48,270
My child

248
00:15:48,630 --> 00:15:50,360
is also your child.

249
00:15:50,670 --> 00:15:52,120
He will surely dedicate everything

250
00:15:52,120 --> 00:15:54,630
to you, Holy Queen.

251
00:15:54,870 --> 00:15:56,420
Please don't kill him.

252
00:15:56,960 --> 00:15:59,690
Please allow him
to sacrifice himself for Liluo.

253
00:16:02,910 --> 00:16:05,110
You are very loyal to me, the Holy Queen.

254
00:16:05,630 --> 00:16:06,670
In this case,

255
00:16:07,670 --> 00:16:08,750
I hereby allow you

256
00:16:08,960 --> 00:16:11,150
to sacrifice your life for Liluo.

257
00:16:23,510 --> 00:16:24,750
I see.

258
00:16:26,320 --> 00:16:28,380
Thank you for your mercy, Moon Queen.

259
00:17:17,579 --> 00:17:18,450
[Huang Gang]

260
00:17:23,220 --> 00:17:24,990
[Jiang Zeshui]

261
00:17:39,730 --> 00:17:41,350
[Hu Hai]

262
00:17:52,780 --> 00:17:54,550
[Tang Yiming]

263
00:18:07,030 --> 00:18:08,480
She is in the Moon Robe.

264
00:18:08,650 --> 00:18:10,920
Holy Queen, Qiangong Linglong.

265
00:18:11,070 --> 00:18:12,600
We must eliminate the root!

266
00:18:13,200 --> 00:18:14,000
Hold on!

267
00:18:16,270 --> 00:18:19,010
The child is innocent.

268
00:18:20,640 --> 00:18:21,440
Tell me!

269
00:18:22,350 --> 00:18:23,760
Where is the treasure vault

270
00:18:23,760 --> 00:18:24,400
of Liluo?

271
00:18:24,830 --> 00:18:26,110
Tell us what you know,

272
00:18:26,110 --> 00:18:27,680
and we can spare your life.

273
00:18:27,840 --> 00:18:28,960
You are wrong.

274
00:18:29,880 --> 00:18:31,540
Liluo's sorcery is powerful.

275
00:18:31,640 --> 00:18:33,110
Only if we kill their leader

276
00:18:33,110 --> 00:18:34,720
can we shatter their morale

277
00:18:34,720 --> 00:18:36,450
and secure a complete victory.

278
00:18:36,510 --> 00:18:38,200
Let me be frank with you.

279
00:18:38,640 --> 00:18:40,300
We'll both take the treasures

280
00:18:40,350 --> 00:18:42,070
and your life.

281
00:18:42,510 --> 00:18:43,440
However,

282
00:18:43,640 --> 00:18:45,310
if you tell us,

283
00:18:45,880 --> 00:18:47,880
we can give you a quick death.

284
00:18:48,880 --> 00:18:50,140
Will you tell us or not?

285
00:18:50,640 --> 00:18:52,040
Guys, guys, listen to me.

286
