Why is it empty?

572
00:32:45,510 --> 00:32:47,640
With the Liluo people's help, Tang Wei

573
00:32:47,960 --> 00:32:50,270
learned the Illusion of Mirrors and Water.

574
00:32:50,270 --> 00:32:52,160
Ten years ago,
when you were seriously ill,

575
00:32:52,160 --> 00:32:54,440
he seized the chance
to alter your appearance

576
00:32:54,440 --> 00:32:56,790
and applied the soul-shifting hypnotism.

577
00:32:56,790 --> 00:32:57,590
This way,

578
00:32:57,680 --> 00:32:59,510
you were completely convinced

579
00:32:59,510 --> 00:33:01,680
that you were the butler
of the Tang Mansion,

580
00:33:01,680 --> 00:33:02,790
Qin Dayuan.

581
00:33:02,880 --> 00:33:03,920
The proof is that

582
00:33:04,510 --> 00:33:05,400
the Divine Constable Bureau

583
00:33:05,400 --> 00:33:07,240
couldn't find
Tang Yiming's corpse anywhere.

584
00:33:07,240 --> 00:33:08,400
He's not dead,

585
00:33:08,440 --> 00:33:10,240
so there's no corpse of his.

586
00:33:10,510 --> 00:33:12,440
Tang Wei wanted Tang Yiming to live

587
00:33:12,640 --> 00:33:13,880
and even become another person

588
00:33:13,880 --> 00:33:15,110
to help him take revenge

589
00:33:15,110 --> 00:33:16,310
and kill the accomplices like Huang Gang

590
00:33:16,310 --> 00:33:17,110
and Jiang Zeshui.

591
00:33:17,110 --> 00:33:18,370
But come to think of it.

592
00:33:19,070 --> 00:33:20,110
If we hadn't exposed

593
00:33:20,110 --> 00:33:21,310
the Illusion of Mirrors and Water,

594
00:33:21,310 --> 00:33:22,510
Tang Yiming would have died

595
00:33:22,510 --> 00:33:23,830
believing that he was Qin Dayuan.

596
00:33:23,830 --> 00:33:24,720
In this case,

597
00:33:24,920 --> 00:33:25,750
wouldn't Tang Wei's revenge

598
00:33:25,750 --> 00:33:27,000
come to nothing?

599
00:33:52,480 --> 00:33:54,510
Where did you find this corpse

600
00:33:55,270 --> 00:33:56,920
and the luminous pearl?

601
00:33:56,920 --> 00:33:59,270
There is a secret chamber
in Tang Wei's room.

602
00:33:59,270 --> 00:34:00,960
Tang Wei left a will stating that no one

603
00:34:00,960 --> 00:34:02,110
is allowed to enter his room other than

604
00:34:02,110 --> 00:34:03,640
those from the Divine Constable Bureau,

605
00:34:03,640 --> 00:34:05,680
not even Qin Dayuan.

606
00:34:13,320 --> 00:34:14,400
I see.

607
00:34:15,440 --> 00:34:16,440
This way,

608
00:34:16,880 --> 00:34:18,880
even the silliest person would know

609
00:34:18,880 --> 00:34:21,210
that there is a secret
hidden in that room.

610
00:34:21,960 --> 00:34:23,630
Turns out that Tang Wei had long planned

611
00:34:23,630 --> 00:34:25,630
for the Divine Constable Bureau
to find the body.

612
00:34:25,630 --> 00:34:27,389
Once we find the body,

613
00:34:27,550 --> 00:34:30,000
we'd know that he is fake Qin Dayuan.

614
00:34:30,110 --> 00:34:32,639
There is a secret left
in this luminous pearl.

615
00:34:32,659 --> 00:34:33,469
So,

616
00:34:34,320 --> 00:34:35,670
even if we failed to expose

617
00:34:35,670 --> 00:34:38,230
the trick
of the Illusion of Mirrors and Water,

618
00:34:38,230 --> 00:34:40,489
we would still be able to learn the truth.

619
00:34:40,670 --> 00:34:42,000
What if I say this item

620
00:34:42,030 --> 00:34:44,440
is related to Liluo?

621
00:34:52,110 --> 00:34:52,920
So,

622
00:34:53,880 --> 00:34:54,960
Mr. Tang left the jade pendant

623
00:34:54,960 --> 00:34:56,280
to me

624
00:34:57,280 --> 00:34:58,810
actually for this purpose.

625
00:34:59,510 --> 00:35:00,610
He knew we would definitely

626
00:35:00,610 --> 00:35:02,010
find the luminous pearl,

627
00:35:02,070 --> 00:35:03,670
and he also knew
you would definitely discover

628
00:35:03,670 --> 00:35:06,870
the mechanism of the luminous pearl
and the jade pendant.

629
00:35:40,150 --> 00:35:42,320
Tang Wei recorded how he used

630
00:35:42,760 --> 00:35:45,090
the Illusion of Mirrors and Water to alter

631
00:35:46,150 --> 00:35:47,230
Lord Tang's appearance

632
00:35:47,230 --> 00:35:48,430
in the form of images.

633
00:35:50,480 --> 00:35:52,140
The Tang family's mechanisms

634
00:35:52,500 --> 00:35:54,320
are indeed ingenious.

635
00:36:05,110 --> 00:36:05,710
Can't believe

636
00:36:05,710 --> 00:36:06,960
he recorded all the crimes

637
00:36:06,960 --> 00:36:08,320
he committed one by one.

638
00:36:09,880 --> 00:36:11,960
As long as we discover the images stored

639
00:36:11,960 --> 00:36:13,290
in this luminous pearl,

640
00:36:13,670 --> 00:36:15,590
the whole story and the truth

641
00:36:16,070 --> 00:36:17,670
will just come to light.

642
00:36:18,110 --> 00:36:20,110
I taught him the mechanism skills.

643
00:36:20,960 --> 00:36:22,760
This child was really talented.

644
00:36:24,110 --> 00:36:25,880
He was clever

645
00:36:26,680 --> 00:36:28,140
and surpassed his master.

646
00:36:28,880 --> 00:36:30,710
He made this for me to see.

647
00:36:31,110 --> 00:36:32,110
He wanted me

648
00:36:32,750 --> 00:36:35,320
to regret it for the rest of my life.

649
00:36:37,550 --> 00:36:38,440
Lord Tang,

650
00:36:39,360 --> 00:36:40,630
please go back with us.

651
00:36:42,960 --> 00:36:44,760
Although you killed General Hu,

652
00:36:44,760 --> 00:36:46,320
Lord Huang, and Lord Jiang,

653
00:36:46,630 --> 00:36:47,880
your mind was controlled by someone else.

654
00:36:47,880 --> 00:36:49,080
You are also a victim.

655
00:36:49,280 --> 00:36:50,550
You won't receive a heavy sentence.

656
00:36:50,550 --> 00:36:51,710
What is

657
00:36:54,630 --> 00:36:55,590
the point

658
00:36:57,320 --> 00:36:59,440
of living for me?

659
00:37:04,280 --> 00:37:05,110
Lord Tang,

660
00:37:05,710 --> 00:37:07,670
Mr. Tang was scheming,

661
00:37:07,880 --> 00:37:08,670
but

662
00:37:12,150 --> 00:37:13,400
he never forgot the bond you shared

663
00:37:13,400 --> 00:37:15,000
as father and son.

664
00:37:15,880 --> 00:37:17,880
The bond we shared as father and son?

665
00:37:19,670 --> 00:37:20,880
You are wrong.

666
00:37:21,440 --> 00:37:24,000
Wei didn't hate Huang Gang,

667
00:37:24,510 --> 00:37:25,670
Hu Hai,

668
00:37:26,670 --> 00:37:28,110
or Jiang Zeshui.

669
00:37:30,280 --> 00:37:31,880
He hated me.

670
00:37:32,750 --> 00:37:34,440
He hated me for saving him,

671
00:37:34,480 --> 00:37:35,590
raising him,

672
00:37:36,070 --> 00:37:38,230
and making him suffer

673
00:37:39,920 --> 00:37:43,400
in this living hell for 47 years.

674
00:37:45,840 --> 00:37:46,710
You are wrong.

675
00:37:49,840 --> 00:37:50,630
Look.

676
00:38:02,360 --> 00:38:03,110
I will definitely

677
00:38:03,110 --> 00:38:04,910
give you the best of everything.

678
00:38:05,550 --> 00:38:06,880
I will make it up to you

679
00:38:07,120 --> 00:38:09,250
and raise you to be an outstanding man.

680
00:38:16,280 --> 00:38:17,110
This is...

681
00:38:22,880 --> 00:38:24,280
Father, try this.

682
00:38:24,280 --> 00:38:25,400
It's really delicious.

683
00:38:25,400 --> 00:38:26,370
No, thanks.

684
00:38:26,480 --> 00:38:27,480
Just take a bite.

685
00:38:27,480 --> 00:38:27,960
Just one bite.

686
00:38:27,960 --> 00:38:29,440
Alright, I'll take a bite.

687
00:38:30,030 --> 00:38:31,770
[Dignity]

688
00:38:42,440 --> 00:38:43,230
Father!

689
00:38:45,550 --> 00:38:46,360
Wei.

690
00:38:51,710 --> 00:38:54,740
[Dignity]

691
00:39:17,920 --> 00:39:18,670
Wei,

692
00:39:19,280 --> 00:39:20,510
I will be away for a few days.

693
00:39:20,510 --> 00:39:22,370
Don't forget to do your homework.

694
00:39:24,920 --> 00:39:26,120
Don't worry, Father.

695
00:39:44,440 --> 00:39:46,040
Although Tang Wei hated you,

696
00:39:46,920 --> 00:39:48,150
he remembered

697
00:39:48,150 --> 00:39:49,230
every moment

698
00:39:49,760 --> 00:39:51,030
you shared.

699
00:39:51,110 --> 00:39:51,920
That's right.

700
00:39:52,880 --> 00:39:55,080
The Liluo luminous pearl is priceless.

701
00:39:55,280 --> 00:39:56,760
He insisted on making this mechanism

702
00:39:56,760 --> 00:39:58,620
even at the cost of destroying it.

703
00:39:59,070 --> 00:40:01,000
It's enough to prove that your bond

704
00:40:01,030 --> 00:40:03,320
mattered so much to him.

705
00:40:05,670 --> 00:40:06,510
Wei,

706
00:40:07,360 --> 00:40:08,670
you painstakingly

707
00:40:09,280 --> 00:40:11,670
laid out your plans for the past 10 years.

708
00:40:14,030 --> 00:40:18,030
And you left alone,

709
00:40:18,670 --> 00:40:20,030
without even knowing

710
00:40:22,110 --> 00:40:24,590
if your plans would succeed.

711
00:40:25,840 --> 00:40:26,630
Wei,

712
00:40:27,230 --> 00:40:30,280
you were just like how you used to be
when you were a child.

713
00:40:30,280 --> 00:40:32,590
I am coming to reunite with you now.

714
00:40:46,000 --> 00:40:46,800
My Lord.

715
00:41:19,440 --> 00:41:21,240
Perhaps living was the real pain

716
00:41:22,070 --> 00:41:23,440
to him, just as he said.

717
00:41:25,320 --> 00:41:26,510
Before he died,

718
00:41:27,510 --> 00:41:30,110
he learned that Tang Wei
still cared about him.

719
00:41:30,150 --> 00:41:30,960
I suppose...

720
00:41:32,840 --> 00:41:34,670
he died without regrets.

721
00:41:40,310 --> 00:41:41,820
[God of Hatred, Haiqu]

722
00:41:57,280 --> 00:41:58,280
-Chief.
-Chief.

723
00:41:59,110 --> 00:42:00,280
Tang Yiming is dead,

724
00:42:00,320 --> 00:42:01,880
but we still haven't figured out

725
00:42:01,880 --> 00:42:03,140
who the former citizen

726
00:42:03,150 --> 00:42:04,630
of Liluo he mentioned really is.

727
00:42:04,630 --> 00:42:06,670
This case is not solved yet.

728
00:42:10,510 --> 00:42:11,280
Li Si,

729
00:42:11,840 --> 00:42:12,670
you once said that

730
00:42:12,670 --> 00:42:14,000
a middle-aged man with a square face

731
00:42:14,000 --> 00:42:14,860
and narrow eyes

732
00:42:15,280 --> 00:42:16,940
showed up at Lanyue Pavilion.

733
00:42:17,360 --> 00:42:18,630
I asked him before,

734
00:42:19,550 --> 00:42:20,920
and he said he forgot.

735
00:42:20,920 --> 00:42:22,230
How would he confess?

736
00:42:22,670 --> 00:42:24,270
He must be hiding something.

737
00:42:24,670 --> 00:42:26,190
Seems like we still need

738
00:42:26,190 --> 00:42:27,110
to arrest everyone

739
00:42:27,110 --> 00:42:29,150
in the Tang Mansion
for strict interrogation.

740
00:42:29,150 --> 00:42:30,510
With so many people at Lanyue Pavilion,

741
00:42:30,510 --> 00:42:33,440
someone must have seen
that former citizen of Liluo.

742
00:42:36,030 --> 00:42:37,840
I wonder if you agree, Chief.

743
00:42:49,760 --> 00:42:52,290
So you've been thinking about

744
00:42:52,510 --> 00:42:54,280
that person outside the Tianshu Pavilion

745
00:42:54,280 --> 00:42:55,510
and suspecting me

746
00:42:55,920 --> 00:42:57,980
ever since the Lanyue Pavilion case.

747
00:42:58,510 --> 00:42:59,440
Then,

748
00:43:00,030 --> 00:43:01,110
follow me.

749
00:43:26,370 --> 00:43:29,140
[Tianshu Pavilion]

750
00:44:22,760 --> 00:44:23,550
You're here.

751
00:44:24,330 --> 00:44:25,770
What took you so long?

752
00:44:26,590 --> 00:44:27,400
Master,

753
00:44:29,360 --> 00:44:31,220
I am looking for a middle-aged man

754
00:44:31,630 --> 00:44:33,840
with a square face and narrow eyes.

755
00:44:36,550 --> 00:44:37,440
Too bad

756
00:44:38,280 --> 00:44:40,280
I haven't seen such a person.

757
00:44:45,550 --> 00:44:47,010
The person I'm looking for

758
00:44:48,030 --> 00:44:49,110
once stayed

759
00:44:50,670 --> 00:44:52,730
at Lanyue Pavilion several days ago.

760
00:44:54,840 --> 00:44:55,970
What a coincidence.

761
00:44:57,230 --> 00:44:58,840
I actually went

762
00:44:58,840 --> 00:45:01,030
to Lanyue Pavilion the other day.

763
00:45:02,710 --> 00:45:05,280
It's the Top 1 Pavilion in Great Shi,
where you can

764
00:45:05,280 --> 00:45:07,610
go up high
and enjoy the view from up there.

765
00:45:07,670 --> 00:45:09,110
And best of all,

766
00:45:10,510 --> 00:45:11,440
it's quiet.

767
00:45:14,070 --> 00:45:15,800
It's much more to my liking

768
00:45:17,510 --> 00:45:19,970
compared to your Star-Gathering Pavilion.

769
00:45:26,760 --> 00:45:28,220
The person I'm looking for

770
00:45:30,030 --> 00:45:31,230
is from Liluo.
